36
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:17,950
Episode 6: Kickoff! Nankatsu vs. Shutetsu!
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE

37
00:02:18,570 --> 00:02:22,370
- April 22nd, Private Shutetsu Elementary -

38
00:02:22,370 --> 00:02:26,250
The confrontation between Nankatsu Elementary and Shutetsu Elementary was beginning.

39
00:02:26,910 --> 00:02:28,670
One point and the match is over.

40
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:35,590
It didn't take long for the two schools to put their names on the line and engage...

41
00:02:35,590 --> 00:02:38,590
...in a fierce struggle accompanied by cheers.

42
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:43,100
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

43
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:44,970
Miss!

44
00:02:46,350 --> 00:02:49,060
Look, what happened to Anego?

45
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:52,980
I don't know. What is she doing at such an important moment?

46
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:55,650
Forget about her and raise your voices higher!

47
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:56,530
Okay!

48
00:02:56,530 --> 00:02:58,360
Let's go to the sports field this time.

49
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:02,450
Okay, this year's Nankatsu Basketball Club is in great shape.

50
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:08,000
The soccer club.

51
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,290
That's it, we've arrived.

52
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:14,380
What were you doing until now? You didn't attend the opening ceremony.

53
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:17,840
We were doing last-minute practice and...

54
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:21,220
...reviewing the plan, right Tsubasa?

55
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:21,800
Yes.

56
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,300
Match time has arrived.

57
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:28,560
I can finally face Wakabayashi-kun.

58
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:34,360
Alright... According to this year's schedule...

59
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,650
...the soccer match is at the very end.

60
00:03:37,650 --> 00:03:40,110
Everyone, we have time until then.

61
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:42,110
Let's go watch the other clubs' matches.

62
00:03:42,110 --> 00:03:42,860
Okay.

63
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:46,490
We have to win the interschool tournament without leaving it to them.

64
00:03:46,490 --> 00:03:48,240
What did you say?!

65
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:51,460
Are you underestimating the soccer club?!

66
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:52,750
I'm not!

67
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:00,300
This will be our little fortress for now.

68
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:10,060
Dad, the view here is amazing.

69
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,980
Tarou, I'm going out.

70
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:17,980
Okay.

71
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,150
Alright, let's go.

72
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,540
Roberto?

73
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:37,840
His mother.

74
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:40,090
What are you doing here?

75
00:04:40,090 --> 00:04:43,880
There's a long time until the soccer match starts.

76
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:46,760
No, I was just dozing off.

77
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:51,180
While looking at the field from here...

78
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:56,730
...I'm imagining what kind of game Tsubasa will play today.

79
00:04:58,060 --> 00:05:02,400
I was very surprised while practicing with Tsubasa for two weeks.

80
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:06,200
It's as if Tsubasa is my soul twin.

81
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:13,620
When I think to myself, "Move like this, shoot there,"...

82
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:18,250
...Tsubasa dribbles towards that spot and shoots towards that spot.

83
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:23,510
Today I'm sure that watching Tsubasa's game...

84
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:26,720
...will feel like I'm playing myself.

85
00:05:30,470 --> 00:05:34,560
I feel it in my gut that you'll introduce Tsubasa to the world.

86
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,310
What?

87
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:37,650
Tsubasa always says:

88
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:41,070
I dream of making Japanese soccer the best soccer in the world.

89
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:44,070
What a big dream.

90
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:47,200
And a dream worth fighting for.

91
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:57,390
One day, let's make that dream come true together, Tsubasa.

92
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:03,090
The boys' 200-meter race will take place now.

93
00:06:03,090 --> 00:06:05,590
What? Lane 6 is empty.

94
00:06:05,590 --> 00:06:09,640
Our participant withdrew due to injury.

95
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:14,470
But this year's participants were pretty bad too.

96
00:06:14,470 --> 00:06:17,350
Shutetsu has taken all the first places.

97
00:06:17,350 --> 00:06:18,850
What did you say?!

98
00:06:18,850 --> 00:06:21,810
What are you acting all high and mighty for as the soccer club?

99
00:06:21,810 --> 00:06:22,940
What?!

100
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:25,650
You guys always lose.

101
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:29,240
You lost 30-0 against Shutetsu.

102
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,410
Take your seats.

103
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:34,490
Shutetsu has Wakabayashi who won without conceding a single goal.

104
00:06:34,490 --> 00:06:37,160
You won't even score one goal.

105
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:38,920
Ready.

106
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:42,290
Are you asking for trouble?!

107
00:06:42,290 --> 00:06:43,670
Ishizaki-kun!

108
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,710
Look over there.

109
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:46,460
What is it?

110
00:06:47,220 --> 00:06:48,550
What?!

111
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,720
Alright...

112
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,350
Tsubasa!

113
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:59,690
What is he doing?! Who is that?!

114
00:06:59,690 --> 00:07:04,070
A kid suddenly dribbling onto the field.

115
00:07:06,940 --> 00:07:08,530
This is absurd!

116
00:07:08,530 --> 00:07:11,740
How can he be faster than people running normally?!

117
00:07:11,740 --> 00:07:16,240
Here he comes, comes, comes! The mysterious dribbling kid is coming!

118
00:07:20,250 --> 00:07:21,880
Wow!

119
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:25,500
The dribbling kid has taken the lead!

120
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:27,380
Amazing, Tsubasa!

121
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:31,380
The mysterious dribbling kid is turning wonderfully!

122
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:33,890
He hasn't lost speed!

123
00:07:34,100 --> 00:07:35,720
What in the world is this?!

124
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,810
Impossible!

125
00:07:37,930 --> 00:07:40,690
There! The final part of the race has come!

126
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:43,520
Alright, final sprint!

127
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:46,900
Wow! The dribbling kid has gotten even faster!

128
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:50,990
I can't believe it! Is he going to continue like this?!

129
00:07:50,990 --> 00:07:53,740
And what happened to you, track club?!

130
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:54,570
Push!

131
00:07:54,570 --> 00:07:55,450
Tsubasa!

132
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:56,530
You're killing it!

133
00:07:56,530 --> 00:07:59,910
Do it, Tsubasa!

134
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:09,630
I did it!

135
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:14,720
He passed! In first place, the mysterious dribbling kid from lane 6!

136
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,600
He did it!

137
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,850
No way!

138
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:19,520
For real though?

139
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:43,120
Alright. I've decided the lineup.

140
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:47,540
Then I'm going to take care of some school business.

141
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:50,340
It was Nankatsu Elementary this time, wasn't it?

142
00:08:59,890 --> 00:09:02,810
Matsuyama.

143
00:09:00,850 --> 00:09:04,100
Matsuyama (Furano Elementary)

144
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:07,020
- Shutetsu Elementary Soccer Stadium -

145
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:16,910
- Yamabuki Elementary Soccer Club -

146
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:16,910
Listen carefully. Thoroughly gather data about Shutetsu today.

147
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:22,080
If we don't beat Shutetsu, we can't go to the nationals.

148
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,330
Shutetsu!

149
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:29,040
But the main thing is whether Wakabayashi will play or not.

150
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,550
Wakabayashi will play!

151
00:09:30,550 --> 00:09:31,210
What?

152
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:35,380
You're Urabe from Nishigaoka Elementary!

153
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:40,970
Unlike you, we came to watch Wakabayashi concede a goal.

154
00:09:40,970 --> 00:09:44,140
Shutetsu might lose this match.

155
00:09:44,140 --> 00:09:46,020
What did you say?!

156
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:49,980
Holy crap... So that's the situation.

157
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:53,530
Nankatsu and Shutetsu are tied.

158
00:09:53,530 --> 00:09:59,450
So this year's result depends on the soccer match!

159
00:09:59,450 --> 00:10:01,830
Things are getting more and more interesting.

160
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:06,500
Everyone, cheer with everything you've got!

161
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,670
Okay!

162
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,000
What?

163
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,340
Are you a transfer student?

164
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:18,130
Everyone is at Shutetsu Elementary right now.

165
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:19,510
Shutetsu Elementary?

166
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:38,030
So that day has come, huh?

167
00:10:38,030 --> 00:10:39,200
Yes.

168
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,370
The day we met...

169
00:10:41,370 --> 00:10:45,700
...Wakabayashi said he would accept your challenge in a match.

170
00:10:45,700 --> 00:10:48,790
Everything started that day.

171
00:10:48,790 --> 00:10:50,460
What's with the sudden change?

172
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:52,540
Are you trying to act cool?

173
00:10:52,540 --> 00:10:54,630
Yes, I'm trying to act cool.

174
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:55,420
What?

175
00:10:56,210 --> 00:11:00,930
It might be a bit exaggerated but I'm glad I met you.

176
00:11:00,930 --> 00:11:05,390
I'm getting excited about a soccer match for the first time.

177
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:08,600
Let's have a good match, Ishizaki-kun.

178
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,440
I'm counting on everyone today.

179
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,440
I'm counting on you too.

180
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,020
Yes.

181
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:12,900
I'm counting on you too.

182
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:15,070
Let's not just have a good match. Let's win.

183
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:16,690
Well said.

184
00:11:16,690 --> 00:11:19,990
I was trying to act cool just like someone else.

185
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,740
Alright everyone, let's go!

186
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,240
Okay!

187
00:11:48,730 --> 00:11:51,980
Nankatsu eleven, we're with you!

188
00:11:52,650 --> 00:11:54,440
What a huge crowd.

189
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,860
My legs have started shaking.

190
00:11:56,860 --> 00:12:01,910
I'm going to play a match in front of this many people.

191
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:04,240
You've arrived, everyone.

192
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,580
Roberto!

193
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:06,950
What's wrong, kids?

194
00:12:06,950 --> 00:12:10,460
You play better when more people are watching.

195
00:12:10,460 --> 00:12:12,330
B-But...

196
00:12:12,330 --> 00:12:14,880
Tsubasa, when you reach the world...

197
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,840
...the atmosphere won't even compare to this.

198
00:12:17,160 --> 00:12:17,850
Yes.

199
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:27,890
So they're used to it, huh?

200
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:31,020
We're dying of fear here.

201
00:12:31,020 --> 00:12:32,520
Wakabayashi-kun isn't here.

202
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:33,140
What?!

203
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:45,060
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

204
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:48,990
No, Coach.

205
00:12:48,990 --> 00:12:51,410
We can't find the captain anywhere.

206
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:53,000
Is that so?

207
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:54,210
It can't be helped.

208
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:55,800
We'll play without Wakabayashi today.

209
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:58,460
Since our opponent is Nankatsu, I don't think we need to worry but...

210
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:00,210
...play carefully.

211
00:13:00,210 --> 00:13:01,590
Okay!

212
00:13:01,590 --> 00:13:03,590
Now for the interschool tournament...

213
00:13:03,590 --> 00:13:07,760
...the Shutetsu Elementary soccer team and the Nankatsu Elementary soccer team will face off.

214
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:17,630
Why do I have to go to Shutetsu Elementary when I'm enrolled at Nankatsu Elementary?

215
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:19,610
Alright!

216
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:22,740
I'll curve it through that gap and shoot at the wall!

217
00:13:25,990 --> 00:13:26,950
Watch out!

218
00:13:30,030 --> 00:13:33,910
You shouldn't recklessly shoot while inside the city.

219
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,880
Is Wakabayashi really not coming?!

220
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:40,000
Yes, this could be an opportunity.

221
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,880
If that prodigy player isn't here...

222
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,760
...winning might not be a dream after all.

223
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:47,220
Our soccer club has been working very hard lately too.

224
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:48,390
I saw them too.

225
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,180
They were always dribbling.

226
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:52,020
Even though they were a lousy soccer club.

227
00:13:53,890 --> 00:13:55,180
Did you hear?

228
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:58,860
Who was the one saying Wakabayashi would definitely come?

229
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,780
It wasn't supposed to be like this.

230
00:14:05,530 --> 00:14:08,160
I wonder what happened to Wakabayashi-kun.

231
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:11,200
Maybe he got scared of you and ran away.

232
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:13,490
Quit joking, Ishizaki.

233
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,790
Wakabayashi!

234
00:14:19,540 --> 00:14:22,210
Coach, the Captain has arrived.

235
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,470
W-What's up?

236
00:14:27,470 --> 00:14:30,550
Ozora Tsubasa, as I said before...

237
00:14:30,550 --> 00:14:35,260
...this match will be a battle over whether you can score a goal against me or not.

238
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:38,270
I won't just score one goal.

239
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:41,190
In this match, Nankatsu will beat Shutetsu.

240
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:04,750
This must be the Nankatsu Elementary school office.

241
00:15:04,750 --> 00:15:08,510
You're dribbling just like Tsubasa-kun!

242
00:15:09,590 --> 00:15:10,680
Tsubasa?

243
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,010
Yes, Tsubasa.

244
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:14,350
Do you play soccer too?

245
00:15:14,350 --> 00:15:17,270
But our Tsubasa-kun is really amazing.

246
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:19,390
Come with me.

247
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:20,940
I'm going to cheer for him.

248
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:22,230
Wait.

249
00:15:22,230 --> 00:15:23,900
I'm Nankatsu--

250
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:27,740
I'm the captain of the Nankatsu Elementary cheer squad.

251
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:30,910
Push! Push! Shutetsu!

252
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:33,780
Anego really hasn't come.

253
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:36,660
I made it.

254
00:15:36,660 --> 00:15:38,040
Anego!

255
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:40,710
Look over there.

256
00:15:40,710 --> 00:15:42,710
It's Tsubasa-kun.

257
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,260
That kid.

258
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:51,130
Hey, look here you...

259
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:54,140
Why are you next to Anego, huh?

260
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:56,890
We just met a moment ago.

261
00:15:56,890 --> 00:16:00,060
I transferred to Nankatsu Elementary today.

262
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,480
What? Transfer?

263
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:04,650
My name is Misaki Tarou. Nice to meet you.

264
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:10,110
Hora! Hora! Tsubasa!

265
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:14,240
Push! Push! Tsubasa!

266
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,080
# Push, Tsubasa #

267
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,080
Anego...

268
